sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Visitor
    actor Attacker
    participant CF as CloudFront + edge function
    participant API as Blog API (Lambda URL)

    Visitor->>CF: GET /api/blog/posts
    alt viewer IP not in AllowedCidrs
        CF-->>Visitor: 403 Forbidden (at the edge, no Lambda invoked)
    else allowed
        CF->>API: GET /posts + x-origin-secret
        API-->>CF: 200 [posts]
        CF-->>Visitor: 200 [posts]
    end

    Attacker->>API: GET https://...lambda-url.../posts (direct, no secret)
    API-->>Attacker: 403 Forbidden (OriginSecretMiddleware)
